### Practical 7: Authentication & Middleware Pipeline REST Client Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Server Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register New User (Valid)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manan Vasani",
  "email": "manan@charusat.edu.in",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Register Validation Failure (Short Password < 6 chars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "invalid@test.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manan@charusat.edu.in",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Attempt Protected Route WITHOUT Token (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Using JWT)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Tasks (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Create Task (Authenticated)
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement JWT Middleware",
  "description": "Practical 7 Authentication & Authorization",
  "priority": "high",
  "completed": false
}

### 9. Task Validation Failure (Missing Title)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail because title is required"
}

### 10. Update Task by ID
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body._id}}
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "medium"
}

### 11. Delete Task by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Test CastError for Invalid ObjectId
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/invalid-id-123
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Test 500 Global Error Handler
GET {{baseUrl}}/error-test
Accept: application/json
